OL,5,G1550 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe last visit is to The Farmer's
OL,7,     FArms in Taunton, where Alan and
OL,8,     FAlison hope that their palatial
OL,9,     Frooms will wow their guests. But
OL,10,     FMichele and Cheryl are unimpressed
OL,11,     Fby a dusty radiator.
OL,12,G1620 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FIt's the final day of the
OL,14,     Fcompetition and the B&Bers meet
OL,15,     Ffor the last time. There's
OL,16,     Ftension, tears and tantrums as the
OL,17,     Fpayments are revealed and the
OL,18,     Fwinner is announced.
